4dd2d18675c375e73","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/clamav-filter/commits/e1bd893df0bcf0d031be31d4dd2d18675c375e73"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fbourasse","id":16238554,"login":"fbourasse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjM4NTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/clamav-filter/commits/f56a5d8b16db894c17d84388f5b3ca5dc88ecd6f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-21T07:30:26Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSÉ"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-21T07:30:26Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"refactor: nest GraphQL operations under a clamav namespace container (#19)\n\nMove the 3 root Query (clamavSettings/Ping/ScanTest) + 1 root Mutation\n(clamavSaveSettings) flat fields under one hierarchical namespace container, per the\nJahia GraphQL convention.\n\n- Query:    clamavSettings -> clamav { settings }, clamavPing -> { ping }, clamavScanTest -> { scanTest }\n- Mutation: clamavSaveSettings -> clamav { saveSettings }\n\nNew holder types ClamavQuery/Mutation carry the operations as instance @GraphQLField\nmethods (the GqlClamavSettings/GqlScanResult return types move into the query holder);\nthe *Extension classes keep a single clamav accessor field. @GraphQLRequiresPermission\nstays on each leaf. ClamavMutationExtensionTest repointed to ClamavMutation (isValidHost''s\nnew home). Frontend gql.js + jsx and Cypress fixtures/specs updated in lockstep.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"8998cf690752c19a814f9e30508428beadac5f88","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/clamav-filter/git/trees/8998cf690752c19a814f9e30508428beadac5f88"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/clamav-filter/git/commits/f56a5d8b16db894c17d84388f5b3ca5dc88ecd6f","verification":{"payload":"tree 8998cf690752c19a814f9e30508428beadac5f88\nparent 0c3f1f25c8b96a53942529bb384bf797ab269d1b\nauthor Florent BOURASSÉ <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1782027026 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782027026 +0200\n\nrefactor: nest GraphQL operations under a clamav namespace container (#19)\n\nMove the 3 root Query (clamavSettings/Ping/ScanTest) + 1 root Mutation\n(clamavSaveSettings) flat fields under one hierarchical namespace container, per the\nJahia GraphQL convention.\n\n- Query:    clamavSettings -> clamav { settings }, clamavPing -> { ping }, clamavScanTest -> { scanTest }\n- Mutation: clamavSaveSettings -> clamav { saveSettings }\n\nNew holder types ClamavQuery/Mutation carry the operations as instance @GraphQLField\nmethods (the GqlClamavSettings/GqlScanResult return types move into the query holder);\nthe *Extension classes keep a single clamav accessor field. @GraphQLRequiresPermission\nstays on each leaf. ClamavMutationExtensionTest repointed to ClamavMutation (isValidHost''s\nnew home). Frontend gql.js + jsx and Cypress fixtures/specs updated in lockstep.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqN5MSCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAxJUQAFLgGDHAtuWVioUQ3xahjmnx\nvcJMFn6va8oACfXcOOLx1eKZJTAuEj2w7sZ5fMaHp7eLpJ37/OZF3RNxzTOxgXc7\