ExZDY0NmY3Y2Q1ZTI4YjAwN2M1Mzg5MDNlNGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/clamav-filter/commit/431fe9d56ba7452f2cea2e97a7c7925b08a4ceb0","sha":"431fe9d56ba7452f2cea2e97a7c7925b08a4ceb0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/clamav-filter/commits/431fe9d56ba7452f2cea2e97a7c7925b08a4ceb0"}],"sha":"28ef4b0b21a0a1d646f7cd5e28b007c538903e4a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/clamav-filter/commits/28ef4b0b21a0a1d646f7cd5e28b007c538903e4a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fbourasse","id":16238554,"login":"fbourasse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjM4NTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/clamav-filter/commits/431fe9d56ba7452f2cea2e97a7c7925b08a4ceb0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-16T07:03:35Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-16T07:03:35Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"message":"security: harden ClamAV filter against DoS, SSRF and fail-open\n\n- Bound MultiReadHttpServletRequest buffering by configurable max size\n  (RequestTooLargeException -> 413) to prevent unauthenticated heap DoS.\n- Scope ClamavFilter to actual scan-eligible requests, forward the wrapped\n  request downstream so scanned bytes are the bytes consumed (closes TOCTOU),\n  and fail-closed (503) when ClamAV is unreachable instead of silently\n  passing uploads through.\n- Validate clamavSaveSettings inputs (host charset/length, port range,\n  timeout bounds) to block scanner-rewrite SSRF that could bypass scanning.\n- Cap clamavScanTest base64 input length to prevent decode DoS.\n- ClamavServiceImpl: bound INSTREAM reply reads, sanitize log messages\n  (CRLF stripping + truncation), use US-ASCII/UTF-8 explicitly, and\n  defensively bounds-check the populateVirusScanResult substring math.\n- ClamavConfig: validate the full update atomically, make fields volatile.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"0ad1c112ccefd359f84de69249d1956cfd27d03e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/clamav-filter/git/trees/0ad1c112ccefd359f84de69249d1956cfd27d03e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/clamav-filter/git/commits/431fe9d56ba7452f2cea2e97a7c7925b08a4ceb0","verification":{"payload":"tree 0ad1c112ccefd359f84de69249d1956cfd27d03e\nparent 3979225d1098a1c35e61e0f5cbb7cef8cac12cdc\nauthor Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1778915015 +0200\ncommitter Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1778915015 +0200\n\nsecurity: harden ClamAV filter against DoS, SSRF and fail-open\n\n- Bound MultiReadHttpServletRequest buffering by configurable max size\n  (RequestTooLargeException -> 413) to prevent unauthenticated heap DoS.\n- Scope ClamavFilter to actual scan-eligible requests, forward the wrapped\n  request downstream so scanned bytes are the bytes consumed (closes TOCTOU),\n  and fail-closed (503) when ClamAV is unreachable instead of silently\n  passing uploads through.\n- Validate clamavSaveSettings inputs (host charset/length, port range,\n  timeout bounds) to block scanner-rewrite SSRF that could bypass scanning.\n- Cap clamavScanTest base64 input length to prevent decode DoS.\n- ClamavServiceImpl: bound INSTREAM reply reads, sanitize log messages\n  (CRLF stripping + truncation), use US-ASCII/UTF-8 explicitly, and\n  defensively bounds-check the populateVirusScanResult substring math.\n- ClamavConfig: validate the full update atomically, make fields volatile.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQEzBAABCgAdFiEEtcDrrZ6KblczSEt9UhsGUDwSL3kFAmoIFscACgkQUhsGUDwS\nL3nD2wf/Zx73KaqgWoRAp+a0qBaOGCQxnCJE/fP+GaGvDOrPYwhCS5hZ8TlX7+iR\nMdMfWl6f1XX8Gc6OEJck5kUg/c87LkPcZ+rTkGEp62qGQIOf9F82lyf2Xfpwseai\nTOeF0qU/KKfH3HmC9LfK1PWHm2Tk3MGf6XPoHvltxG8y0Q1V1LuhzsYlGEYEJfTh\nlGqmGNxzFs9MdjJiLOyBoODxmclI6LaEBufrb6ReUh7EkpBlHSWOZ9D6hj2N3cjI\nW35H4lv8Ze51cujDVXc1EAMKv5w1hE26u9KvmORQY68CdZYCrQKBvua/lxn4Azjd\nPF1x68WP2L2FmwyfjxJ6HRYsw0IMCQ==\n=sG7J\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-19T09:38:52Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fbourasse","id":16238554,"login":"fbourasse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjM4NTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/clamav-filter/commit/431fe9d56ba7452f2cea2e97a7c7925b