Z","email":"emil.khalus7@gmail.com","name":"Emil-Khalus"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-21T13:47:53Z","email":"emil.khalus7@gmail.com","name":"Emil-Khalus"},"message":"Fix Sign Up redirecting to login instead of registration\n\nSign Up on the public landing page called the same login() redirect\nas Sign In, landing on Keycloak''s login form instead of its\nregistration form. Adds a second UserManager seeded with Keycloak''s\n/protocol/openid-connect/registrations endpoint (there''s no query\nparam that switches an existing auth request between the two) and\nwires it through as register() in KeycloakAuthContext.\n\nAlso mirrors the /auth/ and federation-block nginx routes into\nnginx.dev.conf, which was missing them (only nginx.local.conf and\nnginx.prod.conf.template had been updated), and fixes a stale env\nvar comment.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"83f0f3748e74a969dfd98838a2bde5a0ac7a0158","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/onmicroai/micro_ai/git/trees/83f0f3748e74a969dfd98838a2bde5a0ac7a0158"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/onmicroai/micro_ai/git/commits/a84a65c76d3ac1d0c3a11884d8c636c6382351ae","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/79042240?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Emil-Khalus/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Emil-Khalus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Emil-Khalus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Emil-Khalus/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Emil-Khalus","id":79042240,"login":"Emil-Khalus","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5MDQyMjQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Emil-Khalus/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Emil-Khalus/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Emil-Khalus/r