"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gladorme","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perses/plugins/commits/91bfd76c7ef3671fb62c4112b699d3479c0f93ef/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T13:20:28Z","email":"Gladorme@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Guillaume LADORME"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T13:20:28Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"[ENHANCEMENT] Upgrade Oxlint and fix React Compiler errors (#826)\n\n* [IGNORE] Upgrade Oxlint and fix React Compiler diagnostics\n\n- Enforce React Compiler rules as errors\n- Preserve component state across rerenders and list updates\n- Add regression tests for draft and column state\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume LADORME <gladorme@gmail.com>\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume LADORME <Gladorme@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* [IGNORE] Upgrade Oxlint and fix React Compiler diagnostics\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume LADORME <gladorme@gmail.com>\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume LADORME <Gladorme@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Fable review\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume LADORME <gladorme@gmail.com>\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume LADORME <Gladorme@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Replace Perses useId with React useId\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume <gladorme@gmail.com>\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume LADORME <Gladorme@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* [IGNORE] Enforce no explicit any in TypeScript\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume <gladorme@gmail.com>\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume LADORME <Gladorme@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Bump version\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume LADORME <Gladorme@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Fix PieChart\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume LADORME <gladorme@gmail.com>\n\n* [IGNORE] Fix review feedback on React Compiler changes\n\n- Table: follow the current header row when syncing filter cell widths,\n  since the virtualized table remounts it on width, row, or column changes\n- Prometheus: only update the listbox max height when it changes\n- Time series: focus newly added query settings via a callback ref\n  instead of an effect that ran on every render\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume LADORME <Gladorme@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Fix issues 1, 4, 7, 8, 11, 13\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume LADORME <Gladorme@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume LADORME <gladorme@gmail.com>\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume LADORME <Gladorme@users.noreply.github.com>\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume <gladorme@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"2892e918fb7d7199c98f655276071f48ab95e9b3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perses/plugins/git/trees/2892e918fb7d7199c98f655276071f48ab95e9b3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perses/plugins/git/commits/91bfd76c7ef3671fb62c4112b699d3479c0f93ef","verification":{"payload":"tree 2892e918fb7d7199c98f655276071f48ab95e9b3\nparent c4ec2e5647563fe7c31dcafc00e14d545d225f8c\nauthor Guillaume LADORME <Gladorme@users.noreply.github.com> 1791379228 +0000\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791379228 +0000\n\n[ENHANCEMENT] Upgrade Oxlint and fix React Compiler errors (#826)\n\n* [IGNORE] Upgrade Oxlint and fix React Compiler diagnostics\n\n- Enforce React Compiler rules as errors\n- Preserve component state across rerenders and list updates\n- Add regression tests for draft and column state\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume LADORME <gladorme@gmail.com>\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume LADORME <Gladorme@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* [IGNORE] Upgrade Oxlint and fix React Compiler diagnostics\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume LADORME <gladorme@gmail.com>\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume LADORME <Gladorme@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Fable review\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume LADORME <gladorme@gmail.com>\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume LADORME <Gladorme@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Replace Perses useId with React useId\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume <gladorme@gmail.com>\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume LADORME <Gladorme@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* [IGNORE] Enforce no explicit any in TypeScript\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume <gladorme@gmail.com>\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume LADORME <Gladorme@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Bump version\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume LADORME <Gladorme@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Fix PieChart\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume LADORME <gladorme@gmail.com>\n\n* [IGNORE] Fix review feedback on React Compiler changes\n\n- Table: follow the current header row when syncing filter cell widths,\n  since the virtualized table remounts it on width, row, or column changes\n- Prometheus: only update the listbox max height when it changes\n- Time series: focus newly added query settings via a callback ref\n  instead of an effect that ran on every render\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume LADORME <Gladorme@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Fix issues 1, 4, 7, 8, 11, 13\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume LADORME <Gladorme@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume LADORME <gladorme@gmail.com>\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume LADORME <Gladorme@users.noreply.github.com>\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume <gladorme@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxkcsCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAArvUQADE/NqeROI3thDBFO8VuxZOg\nxQpPYnCk327FhRg7tafYQeyOPqyRqVWBhZrIOBXRqSxcXNi0/7QPALysKYuGoPd8\nb7Af5P/hxyIeDfcfLY23Jn/jFD//mOjp3mdGHbbVgK5NXO61qudMU+eFuee2+lCZ\nqyqzZs1NY/JlHWpoUhiSXCaYdlM7cgcQogRvDP5enSDH+Z1Xz3SzAgxNhBC167Y7\nGmhqrRAKXhJlI2Wzve2jlxRz+vHmbFmcK6xEmb7jfGPsmWymAqe+SJWuil18QXTC\nUNtFKyywhDH+gKYD0M0ujJimnlgL0FTqgss8oNe62qVGiZhJWms1UL7o+pBirev8\nuUqBdX99DAPRjFeQXBZacuxIIwu3oQ3wFdvMc1gtWg3951y6IDT8VBkNX/1DtJoi\nXd/xuD3QzCsGLA423zYrna6hOQTZjJlAMS2GHOM8mu3fumP4ABwi0N7dnKi/3ncH\nBYWs0LJrW7xVdMTEjVA537Ww6LuKopzI3680NdUpfrwmnELx401dSFwpLLvDYo24\neyQSQDToDo7NQEqSgyaNA21jd/+MjoBFTHF/bnTlCTCFp4gGZE3m90OdDuoVouqm\ns0+t/Bx6B6b7+L