atchart): oxfmt stat-chart-model\n\nSigned-off-by: colivi <charles.olivi@gmail.com>\n\n* refactor(statchart): address PR #814 review feedback\n\nRename helpers to verb forms, introduce MAX_SERIES_COLUMNS, use Select\nfor max series columns, clarify naming.\n\nSigned-off-by: colivi <charles.olivi@gmail.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: colivi <charles.olivi@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"edf164dd5ad08ee67f0a816a9903c8752b38e7d0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perses/plugins/git/trees/edf164dd5ad08ee67f0a816a9903c8752b38e7d0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perses/plugins/git/commits/a848ede790f3449d4c864ea78be3089ca4c5440b","verification":{"payload":"tree edf164dd5ad08ee67f0a816a9903c8752b38e7d0\nparent f2fad9abe897b409c824d92c05689919ac71330b\nauthor colivi <charles.olivi@gmail.com> 1790335398 +0000\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790335398 +0000\n\n[FEATURE] StatChart: configurable multi-series layout (auto/row/grid) (#814)\n\n* feat(statchart): series-count matrix + optional seriesColumns\n\nBuild on orientation auto from #812: cap auto columns by ceil(sqrt(n))\nso dense multi-series stats stay square-ish (4→2×2) on wide panels.\nOptional seriesColumns (1–12) forces a fixed grid under auto.\n\nSigned-off-by: colivi <charles.olivi@gmail.com>\n\n* style(statchart): oxfmt stat-chart-model\n\nSigned-off-by: colivi <charles.olivi@gmail.com>\n\n* refactor(statchart): address PR #814 review feedback\n\nRename helpers to verb forms, introduce MAX_SERIES_COLUMNS, use Select\nfor max series columns, clarify naming.\n\nSigned-off-by: colivi <charles.olivi@gmail.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: colivi <charles.olivi@gmail.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqtlm2CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAdEUQAGKzSDsJ2k2LZVk2ncO5Cctq\nF5hCue+MwKlXep8rAkNXaA+jTz6RM/e0RXAhiy0f5SdwjEv8HM5mYJLEYzXE5KcA\nPlwo6r2fhkRyBKDe4IdKPE+AcoyvV6uag4ZSr39Lf6yGjgSvHyjnqObSP/TdXjvG\nfDYmEctckwEpAsGLCzbvAm32dsgNMfkw68eau61PfIIExgChkIA/TYgtKmsWa3Xe\n76/TFqD/