ocument the Prometheus annotation plugin (#804)\n\n`PrometheusPromQLAnnotation` ships in the Prometheus package since #642 but\nis not listed among the Prometheus plugins.\n\nAdd a section for it, along with the corresponding data model entry\ndescribing `expr`, `title`, `legend` and `tags` as implemented in\n`prometheus/src/annotations/get-annotation-data.ts` and defined in\n`prometheus/schemas/prometheus-promql-annotation`.\n\nSigned-off-by: 7487 <1042653432@qq.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"14ec20b33fc68c9ce5f3d0263861e7a787ea55a6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perses/plugins/git/trees/14ec20b33fc68c9ce5f3d0263861e7a787ea55a6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perses/plugins/git/commits/10fd8e7d73a84a3a2faa6a31b025a48286843b40","verification":{"payload":"tree 14ec20b33fc68c9ce5f3d0263861e7a787ea55a6\nparent 2229273473954a83afd8aaec018a59001d35b272\nauthor BingEdward <1042653432@qq.com> 1788901716 +0000\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788901716 +0000\n\n[DOC] Document the Prometheus annotation plugin (#804)\n\n`PrometheusPromQLAnnotation` ships in the Prometheus package since #642 but\nis not listed among the Prometheus plugins.\n\nAdd a section for it, along with the corresponding data model entry\ndescribing `expr`, `title`, `legend` and `tags` as implemented in\n`prometheus/src/annotations/get-annotation-data.ts` and defined in\n`prometheus/schemas/prometheus-promql-annotation`.\n\nSigned-off-by: 7487 <1042653432@qq.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqoHlkCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAVnoQADooGcm6gyV2ZXt0HqU3Mx2J\nV6hvwMPiowpoQlDsBTdFAVA/7Ha9zRhHe5jyvAl74LGpe6WYj3Y5wznaKuZwq5Bg\nDvgNybW8yYuqRhACps3UANMhw9gDqPz/PrOT8MDUp6CWum2zv+MGUqsRgcK6UozX\nIem5vP9xAk1Du6LXHXC4K0ekA4HpQAiks6CERLk8WNwWRkj3ble2op0bDRbNcyrn\nm1pndSBbiSuyzN9LxxlSDkffNw3Qp7z+cIsBKKPAWxKfZ3jaP1V3SDugH0v3qhuW\nuDOqGhOvaAIINZ5hnXs/NnFNpgmmmJTa3vU7u8Z