0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-04T12:03:14Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"[ENHANCEMENT] - Added auto/custom legend sizing on multi-series stat panels (#778)\n\n* fix(statchart): multi-series auto-sizing cells with thin scrollbar (#3519)\n\n- Cells auto-size to fit full series names (no truncation)\n- Thin scrollbar appears on hover when content overflows\n- Consistent font sizing across multi-series panels\n- Add measureTextWidth utility for pixel-accurate layout\n\nSigned-off-by: christophrichtersap <christoph.richter@sap.com>\n\n* fix(statchart): add legendFontSize to CUE schema and model\n\nPersist the new legendFontSize option in the plugin spec, TypeScript\nmodel, and options editor so it survives save/reload.\n\nSigned-off-by: christophrichtersap <christoph.richter@sap.com>\n\n* fix(statchart): fix CUE alignment and lint nullish-coalescing errors\n\nSigned-off-by: christophrichtersap <christoph.richter@sap.com>\n\n* fix(statchart): add legendFontSize prop to StatChartBase interface\n\nSigned-off-by: christophrichtersap <christoph.richter@sap.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: christophrichtersap <christoph.richter@sap.com>","tree":{"sha":"c706c7ad4300e810baff3e21cd065d600c24707d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perses/plugins/git/trees/c706c7ad4300e810baff3e21cd065d600c24707d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perses/plugins/git/commits/00403092f7846e72a0f185bca415d44e277e777c","verification":{"payload":"tree c706c7ad4300e810baff3e21cd065d600c24707d\nparent a1e59341f1b33c280f0f08f582ed595b2cc7dd22\nauthor christoph.richter <christoph.richter@sap.com> 1788523394 +0000\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788523394 +0000\n\n[ENHANCEMENT] - Added auto/custom legend sizing on multi-series stat panels (#778)\n\n* fix(statchart): multi-series auto-sizing cells with thin scrollbar (#3519)\n\n- Cells auto-size to fit full series names (no truncation)\n- Thin scrollbar appears on hover when content overflows\n- Consistent font siz