ps://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/perses/plugins/commit/e09f371bb4c7cdcc49b1f9d1fbf36611eafa773f","node_id":"C_kwDOMQ2LvtoAKGUwOWYzNzFiYjRjN2NkY2M0OWIxZjlkMWZiZjM2NjExZWFmYTc3M2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/perses/plugins/commit/878ff926ca15d9df3ee82d9bfbf11eb017691c17","sha":"878ff926ca15d9df3ee82d9bfbf11eb017691c17","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perses/plugins/commits/878ff926ca15d9df3ee82d9bfbf11eb017691c17"}],"sha":"e09f371bb4c7cdcc49b1f9d1fbf36611eafa773f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perses/plugins/commits/e09f371bb4c7cdcc49b1f9d1fbf36611eafa773f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8205546?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nicolastakashi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nicolastakashi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nicolastakashi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nicolastakashi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nicolastakashi","id":8205546,"login":"nicolastakashi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyMDU1NDY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nicolastakashi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nicolastakashi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nicolastakashi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nicolastakashi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nicolastakashi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nicolastakashi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perses/plugins/commits/878ff926ca15d9df3ee82d9bfbf11eb017691c17/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-13T15:13:52Z","email":"nicolas.takashi@dash0.com","name":"Nicolas Takashi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-13T15:13:52Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"[FEATURE] Scope TimeSeriesChart annotations to the panel (#754)\n\n* [FEATURE] Scope TimeSeriesChart annotations to the panel\n\nRewire TimeSeriesChartPanel to consume annotations through the new panel-scoped\nusePanelAnnotationsWithData hook, fed the panel''s annotations config from\nprops.definition.spec.annotations, instead of the global useAnnotationsWithData.\nThis makes the panel honor its dashboard-annotation toggle and render its own\npanel-local annotation definitions. The conversion and chart rendering are\nunchanged.\n\nDepends on perses/spec#61 (data model) and the usePanelAnnotationsWithData hook\nin perses/shared.\n\nSigned-off-by: Nicolas Takashi <nicolas.takashi@dash0.com>\n\n* [FEATURE] Declare supportsAnnotations on the TimeSeriesChart panel plugin\n\nEnables the common panel-level annotations editor tab (perses/shared) for TimeSeriesChart,\nwhich is the panel plugin that renders annotations. Depends on the supportsAnnotations\ncapability added in perses/shared.\n\nSigned-off-by: Nicolas Takashi <nicolas.takashi@dash0.com>\n\n* [BUGFIX] Mock panel annotations hook in TimeSeriesChartPanel legend tests\n\nusePanelAnnotationsWithData pulls in the full dashboard runtime (plugin registry,\ndatasource store, query client). The legend tests render the panel in isolation, so\nmock the hook to return no annotations instead of wiring those providers.\n\nSigned-off-by: Nicolas Takashi <nicolas.takashi@dash0.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Nicolas Takashi <nicolas.takashi@dash0.com>","tree":{"sha":"14699e7a1b6f722ee6e23cce21f86cf08266d771","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perses/plugins/git/trees/14699e7a1b6f722ee6e23cce21f86cf08266d771"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perses/plugins/git/commits/878ff926ca15d9df3ee82d9bfbf11eb017691c17","verification":{"payload":"tree 14699e7a1b6f722ee6e23cce21f86cf08266d771\nparent 6e6b2a3077196fb5662adcf3d177fd522f568ba8\nauthor Nicolas Takashi <nicolas.takashi@dash0.com> 1786634032 +0000\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786634032 +0000\n\n[FEATURE] Scope TimeSeriesChart annotations to the panel (#754)\n\n* [FEATURE] Scope TimeSeriesChart annotations to the panel\n\nRewire TimeSeriesChartPanel to consume annotations through the new panel-scoped\nusePanelAnnotationsWithData hook, fed the panel''s annotations config from\nprops.definition.spec.annotations, instead of the global useAnnotationsWithData.\nThis makes the panel honor its dashboard-annotation toggle and render its own\npanel-local annotation definitions. The conversion and chart rendering are\nunchanged.\n\nDepends on perses/spec#61 (data model) and the usePanelAnnotationsWithData hook\nin perses/shared.\n\nSigned-off-by: Nicolas Takashi <nicolas.takashi@dash0.com>\n\n* [FEATURE] Declare supportsAnnotations on the TimeSeriesChart panel plugin\n\nEnables the common panel-level annotations editor tab (perses/shared) for TimeSeriesChart,\nwhich is the panel plugin that renders annotations. Depends on the supportsAnnotations\ncapability added in perses/shared.\n\nSigned-off-by: Nicolas Takashi <nicolas.takashi@dash0.com>\n\n* [BUGFIX] Mock panel annotations hook in TimeSeriesChartPanel legend tests\n\nusePanelAnnotationsWithData pulls in the full dashboard runtime (plugin registry,\ndatasource store, query client). The legend tests render the panel in isolation, so\nmock the hook to return no annotations instead of wiring those providers.\n\nSigned-off-by: Nicolas Takashi <nicolas.takashi@dash0.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Nicolas Takashi <nicolas.takashi@dash0.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqfd9BCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAOKYQAGiFLgdKQFjJxgQCj4FKQaoF\nNHcUalvWCR+U25yhk0hcjv6pzbRYEZRNx5m14ZDdUwBMO/rHRiVhAuAWDEAAzEvg\nLRotbuGs5SOR7GlN5dIgR1ToYqQNYwJGvxTAHZ1AC+QjSrvDYIWJ9B1mJxJvddUR\nvbC9K+JTAE6/qB5e9JALcXN2lD6uTGN5agGBTw63H/H4r0+4L6DbqZepWDpgE5x8\nOD+eGSHOlHfHZ51uLzuKOhsKlzLPohOt5KbvuT7FZGeG4aiHtHUenxojNULXAgB3\nJfh3FLPmhncPI5Ax34AAJ7l6oxxUz8Bx9zBOXTLp