ge dependencies and scripts\n\n- Added a predev script for cleanup before development.\n- Updated postinstall script to include cleanup.\n- Upgraded various dependencies including @nuxt/image, ckeditor5, dompurify, nodemailer, and nuxt.\n- Updated Node.js engine requirement to >=22.12.0 <23.\n\nfix: update image import path in community challenge page\n\n- Changed import path for empty state image to use assets directory.\n\nfix: enhance authentication handling in API\n\n- Introduced dynamic authSecret generation and validation.\n- Updated Keycloak client secret retrieval from runtime config.\n- Disabled debug mode for production.\n\nrefactor: improve email handling in mailer API\n\n- Replaced hardcoded SMTP credentials with environment variables.\n- Enhanced HTML escaping for email content.\n- Improved error handling and logging for email delivery.\n\nfeat: extend Tailwind CSS configuration\n\n- Refactored primaryOeb colors into a separate object for better organization.\n\nrefactor: streamline test mocks setup\n\n- Simplified mock setup for Nuxt module imports and paths.","tree":{"sha":"830865687f1a94d8b15dac24505cb60acda3b5c0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/inab/openEBench-nuxt-v3/git/trees/830865687f1a94d8b15dac24505cb60acda3b5c0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/inab/openEBench-nuxt-v3/git/commits/7eba9b429ff82a0e2223b499027bdf508307a8af","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99746588?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Androidbeingx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Androidbeingx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Androidbeingx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Androidbeingx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Androidbeingx","id":99746588,"login":"Androidbeingx","node_id":"U_kgDOBfIDHA","organiza