"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33993199?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rolznz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rolznz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rolznz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rolznz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rolznz","id":33993199,"login":"rolznz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzOTkzMTk5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rolznz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rolznz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rolznz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rolznz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rolznz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rolznz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getAlby/hub/commits/3e55ecacedcd48f380a4e1d931ed969ca8266065/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-07T15:24:09Z","email":"33993199+rolznz@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Roland"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-07T15:24:09Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore: clarify self-hosting network setup in docs and examples (#2580)\n\n* chore: clarify self-hosting network setup in docs and examples\n\nDocument that Alby Hub is intended to run on a secure local network and\nthat the HTTP server listens on all network interfaces by default.\n\n- Add a warning to the self-hosting sections of the README and the\n  Linux, Raspberry Pi and phoenixd install guides\n- Publish the port on 127.0.0.1 in the docker run examples and both\n  docker-compose files, with a note on how to reach the hub from other\n  devices on the local network\n- Replace the \"runs on localhost\" wording in the install guides and\n  install script output with the actual listening behaviour\n- Recommend a VPN for remote access instead of a public reverse proxy\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: only recommend a firewall, not a VPN to protect from the outside internet\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"428e6725f14b4a66496c2035f5487984740aa12a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getAlby/hub/git/trees/428e6725f14b4a66496c2035f5487984740aa12a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getAlby/hub/git/commits/3e55ecacedcd48f380a4e1d931ed969ca8266065","verification":{"payload":"tree 428e6725f14b4a66496c2035f5487984740aa12a\nparent 05c0d42f713d5749484d394869b50becd8670da5\nauthor Roland <33993199+rolznz@users.noreply.github.com> 1788794649 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788794649 +0700\n\nchore: clarify self-hosting network setup in docs and examples (#2580)\n\n* chore: clarify self-hosting network setup in docs and examples\n\nDocument that Alby Hub is intended to run on a secure local network and\nthat the HTTP server listens on all network interfaces by default.\n\n- Add a warning to the self-hosting sections of the README and the\n  Linux, Raspberry Pi and phoenixd install guides\n- Publish the port on 127.0.0.1 in the docker run examples and both\n  docker-compose files, with a note on how to reach the hub from other\n  devices on the local network\n- Replace the \"runs on localhost\" wording in the install guides and\n  install script output with the actual listening behaviour\n- Recommend a VPN for remote access instead of a public reverse proxy\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: only recommend a firewall, not a VPN to protect from the outside internet\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqntcZCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAPlIQABbY9TPuNt7kVOFNDHwVnopl\nvXIzts/sZe/81l0fRqRFhp42gVfkKO5yrUP7AyD2S5yYF/aLN+6LFwuN9a50kBq2\nZ0wUHrAUYOXYZXZRsEzidvCTyuRwo4z8Dnb+A0Q1mvKKMtW