in CI with go.mod (v2.14.0) (#2547)\n\nThe Dependabot bump updated github.com/wailsapp/wails/v2 to v2.14.0 in\ngo.mod but the wails workflow still installed the CLI at v2.12.0. Align\nthe CI install and document in AGENTS.md that both must be updated\ntogether.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqfXUXCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAidgQAAiFTBRwIRfr/FvvpwkRtDnu\n+3FoC3Isfn03Kqn10ObRgZ13zWqZCwk8EfLC9agL15YIAGMiBTQ0XRPRUMw49XNh\nH4Vl9GssVywRfxCnhclFMqbDQraO4yMSxE8Lgs9QhxEoaKokhjpnwW7beYSrvZRB\nM/OrcKPUYnXolPfuem6aGA7euIvEZb/qGgqXznckgZDHdpwdvZ/TUmNNzCU7ISEK\nFUQ1QaD9hz9Qkz8WBy7quL1nw8L1vBBwnIE128bHYFR7zCNFIuayJtVliHwMND5a\n6SiU0Vst1QydKlKjVjU2uXGXcpibBIEeU2MgUCdMRO658sEHiqpeP29ZyJI+8s8j\ns7sIwkm0R8dGSykp4/IB2mJ6buL0q0nhcpglSwNhSOvJk9Y44KGZhb9oXkVXmMQj\nukpBN+FQm9lEfOtpnwv24OxseJPlmw7aSMvWxJPvkquVQsfyigYfDJklaWDW2vY9\nxpYCExWtUOpe6UkD/R4a0WbgGuqsFGWFBjU5D5vp0Rl+NskjRULhWgGdHCCVcvc8\nNRHnhDmJh+wgNrJ9yIh1whnq5z9gZCv588/l9x+D1gHIdXfm46cHa/QMtoPNWAra\nnKqNC1XqFU3UejdEnHzHl1yIxDHVY+4ldPvEEqsVeDMgO5ieEI3KddU3IUKaj4D6\n6XJF7jxETDmgF07uJstN\n=FlQf\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-13T07:41:48Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/getAlby/hub/commit/d8ef0e70e0d265a8424276daee0a595ac31993c0","node_id":"C_kwDOMSPVeNoAKGQ4ZWYwZTcwZTBkMjY1YTg0MjQyNzZkYWVlMGE1OTVhYzMxOTkzYzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/getAlby/hub/commit/d2cebc5c6f8ed6df29c2afc2b61383ffad66f79e","sha":"d2cebc5c6f8ed6df29c2afc2b61383ffad66f79e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getAlby/hub/commits/d2cebc5c6f8ed6df29c2afc2b61383ffad66f79e"}],"sha":"d8ef0e70e0d265a8424276daee0a595ac31993c0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getAlby/hub/commits/d8ef0e70e0d265a8424276daee0a595ac31993c0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33993199?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rolznz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rolznz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rolznz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rolznz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rolznz","id":33993199,"login":"rolznz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzOTkzMTk5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rolznz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rolznz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rolznz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rolznz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rolznz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rolznz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getAlby/hub/commits/d2cebc5c6f8ed6df29c2afc2b61383ffad66f79e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-12T16:52:50Z","email":"33993199+rolznz@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Roland"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-12T16:52:50Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: replace react-lottie with lottie-react for Vite 8 compatibility (#2546)\n\nVite 8 changed CJS default-import interop: with \"type\": \"module\" set,\na default import of a CJS dependency now resolves to the whole\nmodule.exports object instead of its .default export. react-lottie is\nCJS-only, so <Lottie> received an object as the element type and\ncrashed LottieLoading/LottieSuccess with \"Element type is invalid\".\n\nSwap to the maintained, ESM-built lottie-react, aliasing it to its ES\nbuild since its browser field points at a UMD build with the same\ninterop hazard. No other dependency is affected by the interop change.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2aa41c83dcf87d6c9350fdc60ac34265af39c21b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getAlby/hub/git/trees/2aa41c83dcf87d6c9350fdc60ac34265af39c21b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getAlby/hub/git/commits/d2cebc5c6f8ed6df29c2afc2b61383ffad66f79e","verification":{"payload":"tree 2aa41c83dcf87d6c9350fdc60ac34265af39c21b\nparent edd283cdb2c38724657d196cc1ed7fb417bb60ed\nauthor Roland <33993199+rolznz@users.noreply.github.com> 1786553570 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786553570 +0700\n\nfix: replace react-lottie with lottie-react for Vite 8 compatibility (#2546)\n\nVite 8 changed CJS default-import interop: with \"type\": \"module\" set,\na default import of a CJS dependency now resolves to the whole\nmodule.exports object instead of its .default export. react-lottie is\nCJS-only, so <Lottie> received an object as the element type and\ncrashed LottieLoading/LottieSuccess with \"Element type is invalid\".\n\nSwap to the maintained, ESM-built lottie-react, aliasing it to its ES\nbuild since its browser field points at a UMD build with the same\ninterop hazard. No other dependency is affected by the interop change.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABC