 with the wallet data.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore: improve copy\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ae35fa2d7c318927c6c75d4e3331db8dfb9ca695","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getAlby/hub/git/trees/ae35fa2d7c318927c6c75d4e3331db8dfb9ca695"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getAlby/hub/git/commits/1c7abc62e91d75e021ad69b2128e46a1c33ac953","verification":{"payload":"tree ae35fa2d7c318927c6c75d4e3331db8dfb9ca695\nparent 1c7c026e541aaa6fb0d631202e955ef8d59c4bae\nauthor Roland <33993199+rolznz@users.noreply.github.com> 1786547083 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786547083 +0700\n\nchore: add Bark terms link and exit disclosure to security page (#2544)\n\n* chore: add Bark terms link and exit disclosure to security page\n\nLink Second''s Terms of Service from the Bark setup security screen, note\nthat the hub must stay online so automatically refreshed funds do not\nexpire, and clarify (via tooltip) that unilateral exit is not built into\nAlby Hub yet and must be executed manually with the wallet data.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore: improve copy\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqfIuLCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAAlsQAAq1qVxubENOKB45B5r5OHoJ\n5vCr9mvdCEB1UsN/qDF03MRL9+IG8OPXC+4luO2NdoxgqLVY0/4RnaYypfN8CTzS\n1GiyWl5mKE1MSyZP4+NJrBuEDyKqYBS4xfc2derwL+/JREdNp9Ly0blxTT+HGjY5\n9AV6AOF8cn7VUDnuxdMoG8cB9QqRubauN0eayP0pBIOF8CwRWaGKhk984kQ5d/8v\nx06kxNzz61AI5HaTt6RpdNEIonqyFXV5u1z30ZayyiIiCjRwM3KTmVwTorDa/u2n\nBdgAhAyaJzY61+LWNELdH9pvQu2Q4z8W8Wn0b0rE9qvjhHH+nDmdA5sN5lenUpHx\n/JQqbw9f7BejN9/zKFTojvmOPcL/nYQ/Oefdkad6TRROQnjMrVcMaZX8mCVQFXR1\ncSWFtEbhdwODeuiN/cPaxLiBD3Jv0nAfFN+Nsc+/nGBIqDdto6QF0Nhddo+f2uxs\n3th8C8x4Oe9DPSBU7jGrJO8Q9z88+ZSXVwsHgnIedlpa7XzWuAggR3GlCT5dZziW\nor++LZMIy3vnC/rdiyP5SxoLqA24XIYzC3ZzRV23g1dZtjqMVx0tROMzBnrO/K8u\