following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rolznz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rolznz","id":33993199,"login":"rolznz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzOTkzMTk5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rolznz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rolznz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rolznz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rolznz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rolznz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rolznz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getAlby/hub/commits/f4010e239acde5ac91678e3b018f604e8299c5b8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-12T05:33:40Z","email":"33993199+rolznz@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Roland"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-12T05:33:40Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: validate swap out invoice before payment (#2536)\n\nVerify the invoice returned when creating a swap out before storing and\npaying it:\n\n- the invoice payment hash must match the payment hash of the locally\n  generated preimage\n- the invoice amount must not exceed the requested amount plus the\n  quoted service and miner fees (with a small rounding tolerance)\n- the lockup address is checked against the swap tree, matching the\n  checks already performed for swap in and refunds\n- the invoice is verified again directly before it is paid\n\nAlso renames AlbySwapServiceFee to AlbySwapServiceFeePercentage for\nclarity.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"cc0d912a6446a589ea8b6f10187e3f72992678ac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getAlby/hub/git/trees/cc0d912a6446a589ea8b6f10187e3f72992678ac"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getAlby/hub/git/commits/f4010e239acde5ac91678e3b018f604e8299c5b8","verification":{"payload":"tree cc0d912a