e8fe8d25f70eee5369afab4f84063abf5adcc"}],"sha":"6175489cb0dc8513b00e59f50e69fcd18bf233b4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getAlby/hub/commits/6175489cb0dc8513b00e59f50e69fcd18bf233b4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33993199?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rolznz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rolznz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rolznz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rolznz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rolznz","id":33993199,"login":"rolznz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzOTkzMTk5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rolznz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rolznz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rolznz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rolznz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rolznz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rolznz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getAlby/hub/commits/bdce8fe8d25f70eee5369afab4f84063abf5adcc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-07T05:39:07Z","email":"33993199+rolznz@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Roland"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-07T05:39:07Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: use scope constant in get_budget permission query (#2510)\n\n* fix: use scope constant in get_budget permission query\n\nThe get_budget controller filtered the app_permissions scope column with\nmodels.PAY_INVOICE_METHOD, which only matched because the method and\nscope constants share the same string value. Use\nconstants.PAY_INVOICE_SCOPE like every other scope lookup, and document\nwhy the unchecked First result is safe.\n\nFixes #2503\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: return error from get_budget on unexpected permission query failure\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c90eda854400f8bee188fc1f0e73d2bfb88107a4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getAlby/hub/git/trees/c90eda854400f8bee188fc1f0e73d2bfb88107a4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getAlby/hub/git/commits/bdce8fe8d25f70eee5369afab4f84063abf5adcc","verification":{"payload":"tree c90eda854400f8bee188fc1f0e73d2bfb88107a4\nparent d94f6933f5f603615bca9c39d44c7227d913f192\nauthor Roland <33993199+rolznz@users.noreply.github.com> 1786081147 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786081147 +0700\n\nfix: use scope constant in get_budget permission query (#2510)\n\n* fix: use scope constant in get_budget permission query\n\nThe get_budget controller filtered the app_permissions scope column with\nmodels.PAY_INVOICE_METHOD, which only matched because the method and\nscope constants share the same string value. Use\nconstants.PAY_INVOICE_SCOPE like every other scope lookup, and document\nwhy the unchecked First result is safe.\n\nFixes #2503\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: return error from get_budget on unexpected permission query failure\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqdW97CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAGwwQAAtaJAZ51IdFnGYvdB/Znabz\nENs747jyTJDiClAD771h/3n4QTuvrgqWTwSIdPEY4C0f66DQ64SM8C4TK0dVEiBu\nL2VXNDHt7VEKRNy4TBb3WBOsodReVXvGjl+9WPVfd+jRsbfxAG6kBJ3UaJeiddsj\nTB+brLFT9fNFErP5y/YMBNYlxDHTSszDJc6F5UmNMAerFcTnT4RX+PeprbmptlVq\nhZWNlm/kwFkcvPxuaj5xelyS/YTEasI5b6j6lIOsXLrTMtHBYQFtC+jOFdaLYZmd\nrxre2TXjcvRF9lPQ11zJVp7YERZNjcogdLA1aUc9ZujcMkK5R0b2YhoZwhiAzS2P\nOZF9IUgIj3yGF1G4KfwsiNQGnIsOhIbXJ/b+4/rv2Nc2flJ5SgMee5+t8X+pJDoA\nedsi2DgOlkSmMqiDE4JxLRn1EgvySyf86lDNxlHwwQ6xmYIwNHgnMyO2DZ4p5S6p\nLaL0