LookupInvoice\n\nLookupInvoice only queried /payments/incoming/{hash}, returning 404 for\noutgoing payments. This caused all outgoing Lightning payments to remain\npermanently stuck as PENDING in Alby Hub.\n\nThe fix tries incoming first (preserving existing behavior), then falls\nback to listing outgoing payments and matching by paymentHash.\n\nFixes #2442\n\n* fix: amount and fees in phoenix payment to transaction\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Roland Bewick <roland.bewick@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"664ecee878fa9ce94365f0813adf8da1f87b0c8d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getAlby/hub/git/trees/664ecee878fa9ce94365f0813adf8da1f87b0c8d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getAlby/hub/git/commits/3b3e784fa6d6fe650635d2d20ddbd57f0b3b6ce4","verification":{"payload":"tree 664ecee878fa9ce94365f0813adf8da1f87b0c8d\nparent fbaff5d8a0fb7420a2e1cd99e505f0e154e29dfd\nauthor Josip <Josipgrcic@gmail.com> 1786011850 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786011850 +0700\n\nfix: fallback to outgoing payments in Phoenixd LookupInvoice (#2447)\n\n* fix: fallback to outgoing payments in Phoenixd LookupInvoice\n\nLookupInvoice only queried /payments/incoming/{hash}, returning 404 for\noutgoing payments. This caused all outgoing Lightning payments to remain\npermanently stuck as PENDING in Alby Hub.\n\nThe fix tries incoming first (preserving existing behavior), then falls\nback to listing outgoing payments and matching by paymentHash.\n\nFixes #2442\n\n* fix: amount and fees in phoenix payment to transaction\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Roland Bewick <roland.bewick@gmail.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqdGDKCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAmToQAFSzldIzBjEqsF4k4F+Dxnkt\nXtA/HiJ+nCkBAAomyd7+AicIwwJ7/GmHJtjJ2Y2e/3jSVZLYVdRB2Wv0tyHLpNyE\njH7uQDgPyTDAVm3T/ZfE/177BvMtbbISV8m01FTHHU0vK8CIl++G1a0q7xu1AURj\n3yz9RgGp5eGf83nHPxGT0WKEuCS6b44zNyAuYV01Zkttx1xvMovS7UITOj7bImC7\n1XlCFxMd4OJUpqniw6A+1it83TSUOY2OY5UubG/AiwbhFPw0w93hwrtGDnHAb+mG\n5GCVn