Ark server now requires protocol version 5\n(hashlock clauses) to start a lightning receive, which only bark 0.6.0 sends, so\nolder clients are refused outright and cannot generate invoices.\n\nNo client changes needed: v0.15.0 only adds to the surface we use.","tree":{"sha":"da346ceb663b28bceb9fa10de3b1b6dd42bbfe6a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getAlby/hub/git/trees/da346ceb663b28bceb9fa10de3b1b6dd42bbfe6a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getAlby/hub/git/commits/355454a4cc006ce10e89c522a60183b38bbc6c19","verification":{"payload":"tree da346ceb663b28bceb9fa10de3b1b6dd42bbfe6a\nparent 806dfd4e1baa140dd183333b13b3ce4fc3e6340d\nauthor Peter <130258664+PeteClubSeven@users.noreply.github.com> 1785987821 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1785987821 +0700\n\nfix: Mandatory upgrade for bark SDK (#2502)\n\nchore: update bark bindings to v0.15.0\n\nMoves from bark 0.4.0 to 0.6.0. The Ark server now requires protocol version 5\n(hashlock clauses) to start a lightning receive, which only bark 0.6.0 sends, so\nolder clients are refused outright and cannot generate invoices.\n\nNo client changes needed: v0.15.0 only adds to the surface we use.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqdALtCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA800QAKdaSqBjlx/Y1FJiu7LPWa2h\nqjV2l4i+lpO+CZ1adWFN0o2N32JcbyPdZnaLpO0P20qvCdO0KBDSU9ln4eH2Ssrm\n6JTyzwIVSTjGQjvzer6lKBiz0eWSb1YFtsUjlDs+Uz+JQnVN8Z69TTA6/exI3PPD\nplQGnZkGvtufvyQ+GCTmlc/ajUGEit9WXGPBgQsQBZz5ANSAIiAq8OXTSlwPa1qh\nEjSejNzpdpkUsldObDDOPut7u//qEa6Bv68TYxj/bAOtHFgVtfQNTV8/xd1OhTlW\nZrXV7PFsRAbQtLEamHOqzEDao4hyxprXBlvmfs8hp6ME5+7Ohoj03EIS1S4AdoMb\nIIG+fL5/C+SEKayUpTfVeu3dKUmqH3sGtal1eRn5RXPOi9cxo/tCSPn4/pjNqktm\n/g+UtpiplYLnztXHQNbLTJXSfbXdmpN7Unp1PaTGX9Ekzt84Pz8ulU7eGePVugm2\nOTIQ5ApwhwJ3DUVPU9SBnGG840cgQ2OmuilGVTqzN1cs8lqk/ELvPsgJ7n0z+X11\nAOWQkC57EzdlFWqoUm6sAl1uWYLxzttX6StChTKgntih2ZGVmxTYgzbnbGbnp6gf\npJXI/08E4qTkCP2QrFTKfDaU1uB+CQDLxdfbqLtMSbX3XdY0sOFEKVr2lpQmNy+h\nrNraGI+RSkKpvDWpVfSU\n=lWmH\n-----END P