com/rolznz","id":33993199,"login":"rolznz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzOTkzMTk5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rolznz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rolznz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rolznz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rolznz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rolznz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rolznz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getAlby/hub/commits/43d37d75d1aa6bb7ea5893776dfe97d621ac0d17/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-05T07:50:08Z","email":"33993199+rolznz@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Roland"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-05T07:50:08Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: bump go-nostr to fix duplicate relay connections (#2496)\n\nPicks up getAlby/go-nostr#6, which shares relay connections in\nSimplePool when dials fail, closes relay websockets on pool close,\nand closes previous subscriptions before re-subscribing on CLOSED.\n\nThe shared per-relay-URL connect backoff is now enabled by default\nin the fork, so no hub-side pool option is needed\n(nostr.WithPenaltyBox is deprecated).\n\nFixes #2481\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"35736971bc916bccd9891b2f5f7a5c637a14ff39","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getAlby/hub/git/trees/35736971bc916bccd9891b2f5f7a5c637a14ff39"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getAlby/hub/git/commits/43d37d75d1aa6bb7ea5893776dfe97d621ac0d17","verification":{"payload":"tree 35736971bc916bccd9891b2f5f7a5c637a14ff39\nparent 8a9ba498072ec0ee159ff633029d11c5a5b547a8\nauthor Roland <33993199+rolznz@users.noreply.github.com> 1785916208 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1785916208 +0700\n\nfix: bump go-nostr to fix duplicate relay connections (#2496)\n\nPicks up getAlby/go-nostr#6, which shares relay connections in\nSimplePool when dials fail, closes relay websockets on pool close,\nand closes previous subscriptions before re-subscribing on CLOSED.\n\nThe shared per-relay-URL connect backoff is now enabled by default\nin the fork, so no hub-side pool option is needed\n(nostr.WithPenaltyBox is deprecated).\n\nFixes #2481\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqcuswCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAzWsQAJOWbkuvgFhAbQSu8IpAIqg2\nisREFQuym4yUK1gzR92H4iWcfQ5aZieUu3NZrzMcP8E/d9q56bk6K6pMp5vx4g/U\ncDTZ1haPVSouqA7AdulDeVw1YN8ot0dK3+3CKU3Gb2tmiU0+2JfpUsewV2J2Ww5F\nWjR/aYzoD6Q6yyTjiGP+MacQP409pWm7aRzOCNxNqcYSyWLE0FU63FdxnH37i3q3\ngI0v0PrluCjCn4PT94okTrszxW5JJMVPtYn9eZjalpHy4ir6/dTNucAlUHIkWyye\nEfHx//1KCYdmXyBrIvXx3tOvHPtMeAzgWr8n25tIdnfK+OIdG7hlTQM5lFlYQEah\nKQyDQSICrj2RD9HkB8bc/dMpyOSkLJ3vgzgZyrTACsBaG8mSKC7Y43CXQy9Tmch5\nKeLibiQZWpIWAyAEkzkoU+UqpcFQpazUwUl3zB8zgShttEHpBvmpmYy+J6KHkVg+\ntaeW/L97terP3CtKcB2m6Ej3Sv7e2UJoxzPPdYOGvs0tpHkmqumfKm0mHu9fxWU5\n5R8fM+E4iM9dmuwds50JDiglowsRhGYlvw4noJhBMmR5/5BAgxhhx668Bf87zcXR\nuR7vyevaq4i7QEZGEXfIRp6O8PPNiN+lxvewvAuNJsx0aTexO1X8DdL8w123vU8T\nUUhfRj1UTJRuT2kyZCmW\n=e143\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-05T07:51:11Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"s