github.com/users/rolznz","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getAlby/hub/commits/4484046ff717edcf99ba089e755b9b71d85c4611/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-04T16:14:30Z","email":"33993199+rolznz@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Roland"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-04T16:14:30Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: use async LDK event polling to avoid polling delay (#2494)\n\nSwitch from polling node.NextEvent() every second to node.NextEventAsync(),\nwhich parks the goroutine until an event arrives without blocking an OS\nthread or an LDK thread, as LDK is migrating to async event handling.\n\nGuard event handling with a mutex held by Shutdown() so in-flight handlers\nfinish before the node is stopped and destroyed, and drop events that\narrive after shutdown starts (LDK redelivers unhandled events on startup).\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5897be91c7b059c8a798285f7d741909291f5e51","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getAlby/hub/git/trees/5897be91c7b059c8a798285f7d741909291f5e51"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getAlby/hub/git/commits/4484046ff717edcf99ba089e755b9b71d85c4611","verification":{"payload":"tree 5897be91c7b059c8a798285f7d741909291f5e51\nparent b051e5eb5f38750e8a73aebed426997dd667e428\nauthor Roland <33993199+rolznz@users.noreply.github.com> 1785860070 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1785860070 +0700\n\nfix: use async LDK event polling to avoid polling delay (#2494)\n\nSwitch from polling node.NextEvent() every second to node.NextEventAsync(),\nwhich parks the goroutine until an event arrives without blocking an OS\nthread or an LDK thread, as LDK is migrating to async event handling.\n\nGuard event handling with a mutex held by Shutdown() so in-flight handlers\nfinish before the node is stopped and destroyed, and drop events that\narrive after shutdown starts (LDK redelivers unhandled events on startup).\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqcg/nCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAZLoQAJXaQ83lmyRV4lBWN+CZfIVF\nvwC5+N/a/QKXPdyKuzSpq4SqM/L9mVsJJ5yr81mMX0lBSF3e0K24WX1gESyPEYvk\norrPDppfGmeZ58QFCXsQIglAvL4Vle7STVwswsojX9SiLTaXvFEuPT6ROnlvHuBB\nkgFrtj4cQTr3MsvXH2//9cyk7tTJXYnt2Q+dxRcCaWIlDTO5h1vPgdvPTDoHPXqb\ntGNAmhlD8waQGJ0s/GlWAq4yDwrdidqHkdozNoaRcXqw90tHJCADXsmXSV4fiYga\nUDy57z967stQfIgVyo9DgNez4HXCu0M5y4R52AQIYRNdGO/sT0Mzh3PjakTApeuN\nUDfTc3zZ44rdES8k6ZCEKQdJ5R1j0g6suYTHMk/IhgfaoepiFAdk1YdkNmEtuInF\nsIX5dp1CJRqWhRKxgcLFmxhFLeotEtzN4LIidZ96tyVMfXg6VOFeYoXJNxy8XAmo\nlopWahfBR9BSZNxgk4kOWbN3qBZroki5Ovrom5Y8ze5gf0rOVJ3q9AJaGPR7YITR\n1/5Y2gnooy/qNRZ9h9sLzLEyQwjGuH6RLqu24rOCRQCslNgNi/w5oOTN1Efv0tFL\n2E0zEUiPwa0LtwDzdPvmMZy1eoTFVagHhDKo8Lka55HmBdQmFaY8lK+zizsZh4oc\n3lzri9ddTP8F8yshm5Co\n=5Tsh\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-04T16:15:23Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/getAlby/hub/commit/4484046ff717edcf99ba089e755b9b71d85c46