c38950ec"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/130258664?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PeteClubSeven/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PeteClubSeven/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PeteClubSeven/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PeteClubSeven/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/PeteClubSeven","id":130258664,"login":"PeteClubSeven","node_id":"U_kgDOB8OW6A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PeteClubSeven/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PeteClubSeven/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PeteClubSeven/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PeteClubSeven/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PeteClubSeven/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PeteClubSeven","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getAlby/hub/commits/ce46a0f8a0038ecdc362c8795de56b8b410524c8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-29T07:25:25Z","email":"130258664+PeteClubSeven@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Peter"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-29T07:25:25Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore: update bark bindings to v0.12.1 (#2477)\n\nMoves from bark 0.2.3 to 0.4.0, which changed the FFI surface:\n\n- WalletOpen takes the network and a WalletOpenArgs, replacing WalletCreate\n  and the separate RunDaemon call.\n- Bolt11Invoice takes an optional anti-DoS token, unused here.\n- LightningReceiveStatus is now LightningReceiveState, reporting progress\n  via State rather than a PreimageRevealed bool.\n\nMovements expose PaymentHash and sends expose a typed terminal state, so both\nare read from those instead of the movement metadata JSON. A send movement that\nis neither pending nor successful now resolves the SendPaymentSync waiter\ninstead of being ignored.","tree":{"sha":"ac667c926f91c3789279c2b3b5248e70d9c957a1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getAlby/hub/git/trees/ac667c926f91c3789279c2b3b5248e70d9c957a1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getAlby/hub/git/commits/ce46a0f8a0038ecdc362c8795de56b8b410524c8","verification":{"payload":"tree ac667c926f91c3789279c2b3b5248e70d9c957a1\nparent be17bc4e261c5b96877c44be51bbdc6208e9bc43\nauthor Peter <130258664+PeteClubSeven@users.noreply.github.com> 1785309925 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1785309925 +0700\n\nchore: update bark bindings to v0.12.1 (#2477)\n\nMoves from bark 0.2.3 to 0.4.0, which changed the FFI surface:\n\n- WalletOpen takes the network and a WalletOpenArgs, replacing WalletCreate\n  and the separate RunDaemon call.\n- Bolt11Invoice takes an optional anti-DoS token, unused here.\n- LightningReceiveStatus is now LightningReceiveState, reporting progress\n  via State rather than a PreimageRevealed bool.\n\nMovements expose PaymentHash and sends expose a typed terminal state, so both\nare read from those instead of the movement metadata JSON. A send movement that\nis neither pending nor successful now resolves the SendPaymentSync waiter\ninstead of being ignored.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqaarlCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAQC0QAGiFUrCMEGlqhhD/Q3/TVmNA\nnZMlI9XzxdkSklgarwrnA7Me4CAozAtfW1RMyPat1XSjdyKkcsnddhx+CwQW/SkZ\nvZaoOGQDp13OpxEYXvxqTbSCYyxs1yufFcKduk+FHwJywdqgtkLdB/52WsF7uFNB\nCkMdijCp1zzO9JzIJCmRxZSMjGTHC5FmNTaXEzlJoStWGC/hoO+I2wRzGZpHKUXq\nGS2btTyoNqXP/YvFpBUT9wO0HvfUaPx0PzLlpv/qNbrS+fJ584hZS+mDZtflAhGo\n37R/+xGcK72pFoYOOFDwfHSrjCPJL5beXLe1IFxZtvN5EP39MwmUoHpC03XB+AJT\nf0qibA2i5rOKT3I9nqTHDqLhrwqxnPw9ZSQEqugohwkA7dAz/Witlg5nBkbd3kSk\nfTLlSsG14oi2vU+Rcy6iEDZefeKhHhwxuFXwaJcdo7UnlsKv1SDi2j5gWn7Ol9lB\nTVlMwzL4fgxtevVU1fJsvP2bj+H0amhJQK/VRXihpZKBdgEwsHX8ZAgOrx+z1+0P\nOByEkGnRIMwwVRIi9lKpjG7r/sUS/K4uAXXvvDkRMceu80K5RKNus8TiaLdIgXuR\nyGu8j35W41cQuYgKf0nBmL